  "question": {
    "text": "If $\\quad \\lim _{x \\rightarrow 1^{+}} \\frac{(x-1)(6+\\lambda \\cos (x-1))+\\mu \\sin (1-x)}{(x-1)^3}=-1$, where $\\lambda, \\mu \\in \\mathbb{R}$, then $\\lambda+\\mu$ is equal to",
